                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-59375**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libexpat1  | 2.6.1-2ubuntu0.4  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/info/libexpat1:amd64.md5sums  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2025-59375](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2025-59375)  |\n"
              },
