                ],
                "security-severity": "8.4"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-15370-libssh-4",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-15370 medium vulnerability for libssh-4 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in libssh. During SFTP server directory listing, the longname field is constructed with unsafe concatenation into a fixed-size stack buffer. When a client causes the server to list attacker-controlled filenames, sufficiently long names can overflow that stack buffer and may lead to crashes or possible code execution on the server."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-15370",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-15370\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libssh-4\nVersion: 0.10.6-2ubuntu0.4\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/info/libssh-4:amd64.md5sums\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-15370](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-15370)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-15370**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libssh-4  | 0.10.6-2ubuntu0.4  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/info/libssh-4:amd64.md5sums  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-15370](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-15370)  |\n"
              },
